       <td colspan="2" width="475"> <span style="width:475px;font-size:10pt;"> <a href="http://kind.krx.co.kr/common/disclsviewer.do?method=search&amp;acptno=20220719000001&amp;rcpno=20220719000001&amp;orgid=G&amp;tran=Y&amp;langTpCd=0" target="_blank" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:xh="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">2022-07-19 투자판단 관련 주요경영사항(CT-P47(악템라 바이오시밀러) 유럽 임상 3상 시험계획 승인)</a> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> <a href="http://kind.krx.co.kr/common/disclsviewer.do?method=search&amp;acptno=20220517000001&amp;rcpno=20220517000001&amp;orgid=G&amp;tran=Y&amp;langTpCd=0" target="_blank" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:xh="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">2022-05-17 투자판단 관련 주요경영사항(CT-P47(악템라 바이오시밀러) 유럽 임상 3상 시험계획 신청)</a> <br xmlns:java="http://xml.apache.org/xalan/java"> </span> </td> 
